{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22997","headline":"春听琵琶兼简长孙司户 · 白居易","name":"春听琵琶兼简长孙司户","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"四弦不似琵琶声，乱写真珠细撼铃。\n指底商风悲飒飒，舌头胡语苦醒醒。\n如言都尉思京国，似诉明妃厌虏庭。\n迁客共君想劝谏，春肠易断不须听。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22997.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22997","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}